---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';

const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-gray-200 bg-[#F8FAFC] text-gray-600 pt-16 pb-12">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-gray-200">
      <!-- Brand & Legend Badge Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-4">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block">
          <Logo size="md" />
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          专为中文用户打造的系统化 Wix Studio 学习与建站推广平台。助力外贸出海、创意设计与企业官网高水准交付。
        </p>

        <!-- Wix Partner Legend Badge Display -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex items-center gap-4">
          <img
            src="/assets/badges/wix-partner-legend-200.png"
            alt="Wix Partner Legend 认证徽章"
            width="76"
            height="76"
            class="rounded-full shadow-md shadow-gray-300/50 hover:scale-105 transition"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6D28D9]">Wix Partner Legend</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-gray-900 font-semibold">官方最高等级合作伙伴认证</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-gray-500 mt-0.5">交付数十款企业出海高品质独立站</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column: Tutorials -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900">Tutorials 教程</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/tutorials/getting-started/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">入门基础指引</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials/design/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">响应式设计技巧</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials/velo/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">Velo 代码与CMS开发</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials/seo/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">SEO 优化与收录</a></li>
          <li><a href="/tutorials/ecommerce/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">外贸电商与金流</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column: Compare -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900">Compare 平台对比</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/compare/wix-vs-shopify/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">Wix vs Shopify</a></li>
          <li><a href="/compare/wix-vs-wordpress/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">Wix vs WordPress</a></li>
          <li><a href="/compare/wix-vs-webflow/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">Wix vs Webflow</a></li>
          <li><a href="/compare/wix-vs-squarespace/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">Wix vs Squarespace</a></li>
          <li><a href="/compare/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">全部对比大横评 →</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Column: Platform & Services -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-900">Platform & More</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="/studio/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">什么是 Wix Studio</a></li>
          <li><a href="/pricing/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">套餐与价格详解</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog/" class="hover:text-[#6D28D9] transition">博客与动态</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact/" class="text-[#6D28D9] hover:underline font-semibold">代建站与企业咨询 →</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-gray-500">
      <p>© {currentYear} wixstudio.cn · 保留所有权利。</p>
      <p class="text-center sm:text-right text-[11px] text-gray-400 max-w-md">
        免责声明：wixstudio.cn 为独立第三方教育、评测与建站服务站点，并非 Wix.com 官方网站。Wix、Wix Studio 及其标志均为 Wix.com Ltd. 的注册商标。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
